{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53966","headline":"答南泉久住投机偈（题拟） · 景岑","name":"答南泉久住投机偈（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今日投机事莫论，南泉不道遍乾坤。\n还乡须（《五灯会元》作「尽」）是儿孙事，祖父从来不入（《五灯会元》「出」）门。\n（《景德传灯录》卷十、《五灯会元》卷四）（按：《五灯会元》以此首爲南泉普愿作，而以南泉之作爲景岑作，似误。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"景岑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53966.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53966","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}